window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v27-015-02440973ea7a5b6d.json"]={sha256:"02440973ea7a5b6d18a8e74002db552498c7995cba4ac8fc0ff6ed7fd573b945",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-94fb7779723cc0fe","url":"https://cdn.kernel.org/doc/html/latest/driver-api/cxl/linux/overview.html","title":"CXL Linux overview","titleEn":"CXL Linux overview","publisher":"Linux kernel project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-015","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-015","related":[{"id":"hpc-v27-016","referenceUrls":["https://docs.kernel.org/admin-guide/mm/ksm.html"],"title":"KSM：解除合併時的記憶體餘裕","titleEn":"KSM: memory headroom for unmerging shared pages","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付逐存取軌跡、容量與熱度兩表、端點測試與模型不適用的排隊案例；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver the access trace, separate capacity and hotness tables, endpoint tests and a queueing counterexample. Explain which additional measurements are needed before selecting a real placement policy. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"建立 content_id、mapping_id、bytes 表；先依內容去重算已用，再依映射算全部分離後需求。","differenceEn":"Build a content_id, mapping_id and bytes ledger. Calculate current backing storage by deduplicated content, then calculate fully separated demand by mapping, preserving both totals and their difference.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["兩層平均服務延遲為 local_fraction*local_latency 加 remote_fraction*remote_latency；只適用此無重疊、無排隊模型；本地 80 ns、擴充層 200 ns；擴充存取占比由 25% 改為 50%，存取總數固定；名義式 0.75*80+0.25*200 = 110 ns/access；變更式 0.5*80+0.5*200 = 140 ns/access。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","若一份大小 B 的內容由 r 個映射完整共享，全部分離的額外容量為 (r-1)B；忽略頁表、碎片及不完全相同內容；共享內容為 40 GiB；名義有三個映射，變更四個；每份在解除合併後都完整獨立；名義式 (3-1)*40 = 80 GiB additional；變更式 (4-1)*40 = 120 GiB additional。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Weighted mean service latency sums access fraction times latency for each tier. The model assumes serial dependence, no overlap and no queueing; it is not a bandwidth or application-runtime model. Assign synthetic latencies of 80 ns locally and 200 ns in the extension tier. Extension accesses increase from 25% to 50% while total access count remains fixed; these are not CXL product specifications. Nominal 0.75*80+0.25*200 = 110 ns/access; changed 0.5*80+0.5*200 = 140 ns/access. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","If r complete mappings share one identical B-sized backing set, fully separating them requires an additional (r-1)B. The model excludes page tables, fragmentation and partially identical content. Use a 40 GiB identical backing set shared by three mappings, then four. Every mapping becomes fully independent after unmerging; the assumption is deliberately stronger than a workload with only a few modified pages. Nominal (3-1)*40 = 80 GiB additional; changed (4-1)*40 = 120 GiB additional. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v27-025","referenceUrls":["https://github.com/linux-rdma/rdma-core"],"title":"RDMA SEND：接收 credit 與完成事件契約","titleEn":"RDMA SEND: receive credits and completion contracts","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付逐存取軌跡、容量與熱度兩表、端點測試與模型不適用的排隊案例；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver the access trace, separate capacity and hotness tables, endpoint tests and a queueing counterexample. Explain which additional measurements are needed before selecting a real placement policy. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"建立 message_id、posted_receive、completion 與 app_consumed 事件；用不同狀態欄位保存，禁止單一 done 旗標。","differenceEn":"Build events for message identity, posted receive, completion and application consumption. Preserve distinct states instead of one done flag, and require unique ownership of every receive buffer.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["兩層平均服務延遲為 local_fraction*local_latency 加 remote_fraction*remote_latency；只適用此無重疊、無排隊模型；本地 80 ns、擴充層 200 ns；擴充存取占比由 25% 改為 50%，存取總數固定；名義式 0.75*80+0.25*200 = 110 ns/access；變更式 0.5*80+0.5*200 = 140 ns/access。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","在無新補充且每訊息消耗一個接收 credit 的模型中，缺口為 max(0,待發訊息數－可用 credit)；待發 120 則；可用接收 credit 名義 96、變更 128；訊息大小均符合每個接收 buffer；名義式 max(0,120-96) = 24 receive credits missing；變更式 max(0,120-128) = 0 receive credits missing。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Weighted mean service latency sums access fraction times latency for each tier. The model assumes serial dependence, no overlap and no queueing; it is not a bandwidth or application-runtime model. Assign synthetic latencies of 80 ns locally and 200 ns in the extension tier. Extension accesses increase from 25% to 50% while total access count remains fixed; these are not CXL product specifications. Nominal 0.75*80+0.25*200 = 110 ns/access; changed 0.5*80+0.5*200 = 140 ns/access. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","With no replenishment and one receive credit consumed per message, deficit is the positive difference between queued sends and available receive credits. This deliberately simplified model is not a full verbs state machine. Queue 120 messages. Available receive credits change from 96 to 128, and every message fits its receive buffer. No credits are replenished during the modeled burst. Nominal max(0,120-96) = 24 receive credits missing; changed max(0,120-128) = 0 receive credits missing. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-e9e939b86b41f711","url":"https://docs.kernel.org/admin-guide/mm/ksm.html","title":"Kernel Samepage Merging","titleEn":"Kernel Samepage Merging","publisher":"Linux kernel project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-7d2d2923d453ec72","url":"https://github.com/linux-rdma/rdma-core","title":"rdma-core verbs interfaces","titleEn":"rdma-core verbs interfaces","publisher":"linux-rdma project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
